| R2 first-send continuation | The queued first message is bound to the start receipt's operation (and to the conversation it replaces); the box keeps the text until `sendHarness` is admitted; a refused start, a failed startup or another conversation drops the queue with an explanation and nothing is sent elsewhere; a refused send leaves the text in the new conversation's box. Test: "keeps the first message until a conversation takes it" | `harness.tsx` |
