nt used the acceptance script, record, observations, all twelve AX trees and four representative screenshots. Native acceptance was not rerun. The retained runs use the pinned engine with synthetic services, establish no live or installed-release qualification, and record no spoken VoiceOver output.\\\",\\\"Manual fresh-exec transport requires controller receipt regeneration after C26. Unrelated C26 and Academy implementation changes were excluded from substantive review; consumed inputs were checked against the inventory. No application source was changed, product endpoints called or credentials accessed.\\\"],\\\"inspected_files\\\":[\\\"AGENTS.md\\\",\\\"GLOSSARY.md\\\",\\\"docs/planning/reviews/C32/attempt-07/request.json\\\",\\\"docs/planning/reviews/C32/attempt-07/source-inventory.json\\\",\\\"docs/planning/reviews/C32/attempt-07/diff.patch\\\",\\\"docs/planning/reviews/C32/attempt-06/verdict-returned.json\\\",\\\"docs/planning/reviews/C32/remediation-attempt-01.md\\\",\\\"docs/planning/reviews/C32/remediation-attempt-02.md\\\",\\\"docs/planning/reviews/C32/remediation-attempt-03.md\\\",\\\"docs/planning/reviews/C32/remediation-attempt-04.md\\\",\\\"docs/planning/reviews/C32/remediation-attempt-05.md\\\",\\\"docs/planning/reviews/C32/remediation-attempt-06.md\\\",\\\"docs/planning/chunks/C32.md\\\",\\\"docs/planning/chunks/C31.md\\\",\\\"docs/planning/chunks/C28.md\\\",\\\"docs/planning/IMPLEMENTATION-PLAN.md\\\",\\\"docs/planning/review-protocol.md\\\",\\\"docs/planning/decisions.md\\\",\\\"docs/planning/dependencies.md\\\",\\\"docs/planning/parity-matrix.md\\\",\\\"docs/planning/test-catalogue.md\\\",\\\"docs/planning/status.md\\\",\\\"docs/adr/0001-native-operation-authority.md\\\",\\\"docs/adr/0003-native-harness-and-scoped-identity.md\\\",\\\"docs/architecture/review-verdict.schema.json\\\",\\\"docs/architecture/checks.json\\\",\\\"docs/architecture/native-checks.json\\\",\\\"docs/architecture/ui-v2/DESIGN-V2.md\\\",\\\"docs/architecture/ui-v2/invariants.